# Canyon Run: an hourglass through the canyon, crossing itself once at the waist: one way
# climbs onto a bridge, the other runs through a tunnel underneath. The far loop is wide and fast,
# the near one tight. Two jumps and no barriers: watch the edges.

name Canyon Run
laps 3
width 16
walls none
colour sky #3A1C71
colour horizon #FFAF7B
colour below #1A0B12
colour road #4A3B36
colour road2 #42342F
colour edge #F2E8CF
colour edge2 #BC4749
colour wall #D17A22
colour ramp #FFD166
colour structure #5C3D2E
colour scenery #8C5A3C

straight 58
# near loop: tight
curve 125 45
straight 63.9
curve 125 45
# up the waist onto the bridge
straight 50
height 9
straight 45
straight 50
# down off the bridge, then across the abyss
height 0
straight 45
straight 5
ramp 8 1.6
gap 26
straight 71
# far loop: wide, with a kink
curve -125 55
straight 17.2
curve 20 60
curve -40 60
curve 20 60
straight 17.2
curve -125 55
# back down the waist, under the bridge
# across the abyss
straight 50
ramp 8 1.6
gap 28
straight 72
tunnel on
straight 44
tunnel off
straight 40
